  "title": "Washington Trust elects Jeffrey M. Wilhelm to Board of Directors",
  "summary": "NASDAQ: WASH MEDIA CONTACT: Kathleen Hart VP, Public Relations Manager 401.348.1495 kahart@washtrust.com FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE: April 28, 2026 WESTERLY, R.I.— Washington Trust Bancorp, Inc. (“the Corporation”), (NASDAQ: WASH) today announced that Jeffrey M. Wilhelm, an industry leader with more than 25 years of data, technology and digital transformation experience, has been elected to the boards of the Corporation and its subsidiary bank, The Washington Trust Company, effective April 28, 2026.",
